## 🔒 Security Tips

### Password Management
- Change default passwords immediately
- Use strong passwords (8+ characters)
- Don't share login credentials
- Log out when leaving the terminal

### Data Safety
- Regularly backup data (export/print reports)
- Don't delete old sales data
- Keep receipts for tax purposes
- Verify stock counts periodically

## ❓ Troubleshooting

### Can't Login
- Check username and password spelling
- Ensure caps lock is off
- Try demo credentials to test system

### Service Missing from POS
- Check if service is active in Services page
- Verify service wasn't accidentally deleted

### Stock Not Updating
- Ensure sale was completed successfully
- Check inventory page for current stock
- Review stock adjustment history

### Commission Not Showing
- Verify barber was assigned to service
- Check date range in reports
- Ensure sale was completed

### Print Not Working
- Check printer connection
- Try "Save as PDF" option
- Verify browser print permissions

